{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09046","headline":"秋夜南宫寄沣上弟及诸生 · 韦应物","name":"秋夜南宫寄沣上弟及诸生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暝色起烟阁，沈抱积离忧。\n况兹风雨夜，萧条梧叶秋。\n空宇感凉至，颓颜惊岁周。\n日夕游阙下，山水忆同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}